<title>USA: Mitsubishi U.S. unit prices 1997 vehicles.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi U.S. unit prices 1997 vehicles.</headline>
<dateline>CYPRESS, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motor Sales of America Inc, a unit of Mitsubishi Motors Corp, on Thursday announced suggested retail prices for its 1997-model vehicles, ranging from $10,400 for the Mirage subcompact coupe to $29,990 for the Diamante luxury sedan .</p>
<p>Following are the 1997 base prices for other Mitsubishi models:</p>
<p>     Mirage sedan			$12,090</p>
<p>     Galant				$15,420</p>
<p>     Eclipse			     $15,140</p>
<p>     Eclipse Spyder convertible    $19,740</p>
<p>     3000GT				$27,050</p>
<p>     Montero			     $29,290</p>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors plans to unveil its new sport utility Montero Sport in December. Pricing for the vehicle will be announced later this year.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
